{{#> layout title="Reset your password"}}
<p>Hi {{name}},</p>
<p>We received a request to reset your {{appName}} password. The link expires in one hour.</p>
<a class="cta" href="{{url}}">Reset password</a>
<p class="muted">If the button does not work, paste this link into your browser: {{url}}</p>
<p>If you did not ask for this, you can ignore this email; your password stays the same.</p>
{{/layout}}
